<title>JAPAN: Daito Kogyo seeks court protection -- Jiji.</title>
<headline>Daito Kogyo seeks court protection -- Jiji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medium-sized general contractor Daito Kogyo Co Ltd has applied for court protection from creditors under Japanese bankruptcy laws, Jiji news agency quoted credit research company Teikoku Databank Ltd as saying on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Teikoku said the Japanese general contractor filed for insolvency with 155.4 billion yen in debt, Jiji reported.</p>
